{
  "name": {
    "ja": "滑らかな関数：Legendre射影とGLL補間",
    "en": "Smooth function: Legendre projection and GLL interpolation"
  },
  "scope": {
    "ja": "exp(x)を次数2/4/6/8でL2射影し、同じ次数のGLL節点補間と比較する。実装の32点Gaussとは別の64/96点求積と独立Legendre再帰式で係数・直交性・誤差を確認する。",
    "en": "L2-project exp(x) at degrees 2/4/6/8 and compare GLL interpolation at the same degrees. Check coefficients, orthogonality and errors using separate 64/96-point rules and an independent Legendre recurrence, versus 32-point projection quadrature."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "参照区間[−1,1]、重み1のLegendre内積。GLLはp+1節点。高次求積の一致を参照精度の補助検査とし、一般関数の厳密積分とは主張しない。出力201点は誤差積分用の求積点とは別。",
    "en": "Reference interval [−1,1] and unit-weight Legendre inner product; GLL has p+1 nodes. Agreement of higher-order rules supports reference accuracy but is not an exact-integration claim for arbitrary functions. The 201 output points are separate from error quadrature."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "参照座標ξとexp(ξ)は無次元。L2誤差は重み1の区間積分から計算する。",
    "en": "Dimensionless reference coordinate ξ and exp(ξ); L2 errors use unit-weight interval integration."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "補間・射影の問題で物理境界条件はない。GLLの端点節点はPDE境界の施行を意味しない。",
    "en": "An interpolation/projection problem without physical boundary conditions; GLL endpoint nodes do not enforce a PDE boundary."
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "legendre-basis",
    "nodal-basis"
  ],
  "reading": {
    "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/basis-functions/",
    "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/basis-functions/"
  },
  "references": [
    {
      "type": "analytic-function-and-quadrature",
      "url": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/code/numerical-methods-atlas/2026-11-22/reference/smooth-function-projection/result.json",
      "description": {
        "ja": "CSVは次数ごとに201点、各行で射影値・GLL補間値・exp(x)を整列。次数別L2誤差、係数差、直交性残差、64/96点求積の差はJSONに記録する。",
        "en": "CSV provides 201 aligned projection/interpolation/exp(x) rows per degree. JSON records degree-wise L2 errors, coefficient differences, orthogonality and 64/96-point quadrature agreement."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "analytic-function-and-quadrature",
      "url": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/en/read/basis-functions/",
      "description": {
        "ja": "exp(x)を直接評価し、異なる高次求積と独立の三項再帰でモード係数を求め直す。射影自身の求積値の再利用による自明な一致ではない。",
        "en": "Direct exp(x) evaluation plus different high-order quadrature and a separate three-term recurrence recompute modal coefficients; the reference does not reuse the projection's own quadrature."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "primary-publication",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcp.2014.12.012",
      "description": {
        "ja": "既存基底項目のLegendreモード・GLL節点表現の文献。多項式基底の歴史的起源の主張には用いない。",
        "en": "Existing basis-method reference for Legendre modal and GLL nodal formulations, without a historical-origin claim."
      }
    }
  ],
  "failure_scope": {
    "ja": "exp(x)・GLL・次数増加・参照求積を固定し、非有限値や不適切な次数・参照求積数を拒否。不連続関数、高次数での安定性、曲線要素やPDE全体の検証ではない。解説本文は現在英語版。",
    "en": "Fix exp(x), GLL, degree refinement and reference quadrature; reject nonfinite/invalid degrees or inadequate reference rules. Not validation for discontinuities, high-degree stability, curved elements or a full PDE. The current reading is English only."
  },
  "reference_notes": {
    "ja": "CSVは次数ごとに201点、各行で射影値・GLL補間値・exp(x)を整列。次数別L2誤差、係数差、直交性残差、64/96点求積の差はJSONに記録する。",
    "en": "CSV provides 201 aligned projection/interpolation/exp(x) rows per degree. JSON records degree-wise L2 errors, coefficient differences, orthogonality and 64/96-point quadrature agreement."
  },
