        "ja": "独立のLegendre再帰式と96点求積による係数との一致。射影と同じ求積を繰り返さない。",
        "en": "Agreement with coefficients from a separate Legendre recurrence and 96-point quadrature, not repeated projection quadrature."
      },
      "pointer": "/metrics/maximum_independent_coefficient_difference"
