      "ja": "exp(x)のLegendre射影とGLL補間を比較し、次数による誤差減少・係数・直交性を別の高次求積で確認する。",
      "en": "Compare Legendre projection and GLL interpolation of exp(x); use higher-order reference quadrature for p-refinement, coefficients and orthogonality."
    },
    "formula": {
      "role": "approximation",
      "latex": [
        "\\Pi_p f(x)=\\sum_{k=0}^{p}c_kP_k(x),\\qquad c_k=\\frac{2k+1}{2}\\int_{-1}^{1}e^\\xi P_k(\\xi)\\,d\\xi",
        "I_pf(x)=\\sum_{j=0}^{p}e^{x_j}\\ell_j(x),\\qquad\\ell_j(x_i)=\\delta_{ij},\\qquad p=2,4,6,8"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "重み1の区間射影とGLL節点補間で、PDEではない。32点求積による射影を、別のLegendre再帰式と64/96点求積で調べる。実行例の式は46モデルの件数に足さない。",
        "en": "Unit-weight interval projection and GLL interpolation, not a PDE. The 32-point projection is checked by a separate Legendre recurrence and 64/96-point rules; example formulas do not add to the 46 model entries."
      }
    },
